        "original_id": "6b13837c-5303-5918-85df-246918d086ea",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Leo Varadkar, Enda Kenny\n- Roles: Leader of Fine Gael, Minister for Transport Tourism and Sport, Minister for Health, Minister for Social Protection\n- Organizations: Fine Gael\n\nFacts:\n- Leo Varadkar served as Minister for Transport, Tourism and Sport from 2011 to 2014.\n- Leo Varadkar served as Minister for Health from 2014 to 2016.\n- Leo Varadkar served as Minister for Social Protection from 2016 to 2017.\n- On 2 June 2017, Leo Varadkar became Leader of Fine Gael following the resignation of Enda Kenny.",
